  "description": "The youngest of a fallen family, Ivnye. On the first night she is sold off as a bride, she kills the groom who tries to offer her as a sacrifice and becomes the master of the Belfer Mansion. To survive in this eerie mansion, there is no choice but to find and subjugate its hidden ghost stories. A mysterious man appears in the dreams of the despairing Ivnye and tempts her...\n\n_Source: NAVER Webtoon, translated_\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[NAVER Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=854857) | [NAVER Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14710384)",
